"""PG-335: a template for the notice that a legal document changed.

terms_updated is not fired by any event. The operator turns it into a
Broadcast draft from the admin, like the sub-processor notices in 0057. It is
seeded so the text sits next to every other mail and can be edited there. A
template somebody already created or edited is left alone.
"""
